# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL overrides the API base URL.
#
# Leave it UNSET in local dev: the app then auto-detects your Mac's LAN IP from
# the Metro bundler host and targets it on port 8000 (see src/api/client.ts).
# `0.0.0.0` / `localhost` here do NOT work from a phone or Android emulator —
# those point at the device itself, not your Mac.
#
# Set it to a fixed URL only for builds / production, e.g.:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
